## `rpc.discover`

**Returns the OpenRPC service discovery document.**

This built-in method returns the full machine-readable API specification
following the [OpenRPC 1.3.2](https://open-rpc.org/) standard.

### Parameters

This method takes no parameters.

### Example

**Request:**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "rpc.discover",
  "params": {},
  "id": 1
}
```

**Response:**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "result": {
    "openrpc": "1.3.2",
    "info": { "title": "UDB JSON-RPC API", "version": "0.1.0" },
    "methods": [ ... ]
  },
  "id": 1
}
